        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, regional train, SBB mix
Average data for the operation of Swiss regional trains (S-Trains;
UUID: 1b890c42-e3da-32f3-bd6b-c9c1f1c116af
The inventory includes the actual energy consumption due to traction.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: all technologies included
Time period: all data is based on situation in the year 2000, except the specific energy consumption per pkm (year 2008)
Production volume: 2839 Mio pkm in 2000  in Switzerland
Sampling: SBB studies and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1b890c42-e3da-32f3-bd6b-c9c1f1c116af.xml</text>
